WEBVTT

00:00:00.780 --> 00:00:03.080
Hello! You're watching 
"Hayate No Gotoku!"

00:00:03.080 --> 00:00:05.470
Hello, I'm Sonia Shaflnarz.

00:00:08.780 --> 00:00:09.710
Oh.

00:00:09.710 --> 00:00:12.560
Sister, it's you! 
It's been a while.

00:00:12.560 --> 00:00:16.620
You totally forgot about me.

00:00:17.490 --> 00:00:21.790
But I'm a kindhearted 
nun, so I'll forgive you.

00:00:21.790 --> 00:00:25.620
We are so honored to have you here.

00:00:25.620 --> 00:00:28.630
Really? Then I'll come next week, too.

00:00:28.630 --> 00:00:31.030
What? Oh, well, that's not...

00:00:31.030 --> 00:00:33.800
But it is quite refreshing 
to have someone on the

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:35.440
show who isn't the usual bunch.

00:00:35.440 --> 00:00:39.110
Right? Well, Ayasaki-kun...

00:00:39.110 --> 00:00:40.950
Will you lend me some money?

00:00:40.950 --> 00:00:43.020
Of course not.

00:00:43.020 --> 00:00:44.670
I'll sing you a song.

00:00:44.670 --> 00:00:46.360
I'm not lending you any money.

00:00:46.360 --> 00:00:48.220
Goodness. The characters may change,

00:00:48.220 --> 00:00:50.890
but they all do the same thing.

00:00:49.590 --> 00:00:52.830
<i>Ayasaki-kun is nice.</i>

00:00:52.830 --> 00:00:54.910
You can sing, but I'm not 
giving you any money!

00:00:53.880 --> 00:00:58.030
<i>He's giving me all his money.</i>

00:02:29.390 --> 00:02:31.430
Go to school!

00:02:33.070 --> 00:02:34.800
Wh-Why?

00:02:35.330 --> 00:02:39.800
Because it's a school day and you're 
a student. How's that for a reason?

00:02:39.800 --> 00:02:43.300
<b> Hakuo Academy</b>

00:02:41.020 --> 00:02:43.300
I wish she'd stop telling
 me to go to school.

00:02:43.300 --> 00:02:47.560
What does it matter? 
Break starts tomorrow, anyway.

00:02:47.560 --> 00:02:50.100
Why can't I just start my break a day early?

00:02:50.100 --> 00:02:52.500
I don't know about that.

00:02:52.500 --> 00:02:55.860
You got scolded by Maria-san again?

00:02:55.860 --> 00:02:57.820
What do you mean, "again"?

00:02:57.820 --> 00:03:00.950
You were always getting 
into trouble when you

00:03:00.950 --> 00:03:02.820
lived in the Yukari-chan House.

00:03:03.040 --> 00:03:05.380
Th-That's not true!

00:03:05.380 --> 00:03:07.750
Maria just scolded me for no reason!

00:03:08.200 --> 00:03:13.060
Actually, I like the way Maria-san 
scolds you like a mom.

00:03:13.410 --> 00:03:15.230
Like a mom?

00:03:15.230 --> 00:03:18.250
Listen to me!

00:03:18.250 --> 00:03:21.180
Yes, like on laundry day...

00:03:22.240 --> 00:03:23.290
<i>Honestly...</i>

00:03:23.760 --> 00:03:26.200
<i>Why do you always bring out</i>

00:03:26.200 --> 00:03:28.470
<i>dirty clothes after I start the laundry?</i>

00:03:29.260 --> 00:03:33.600
<i>I-I can't help it. They just turned up.</i>

00:03:34.300 --> 00:03:36.220
<i>That's why I always tell you not to</i>

00:03:36.220 --> 00:03:38.360
<i>leave your clothes lying around...</i>

00:03:39.500 --> 00:03:41.940
<i>Geez. Quit nagging me!</i>

00:03:43.080 --> 00:03:44.470
Like that.

00:03:45.000 --> 00:03:47.760
Maria-san is strict.

00:03:47.760 --> 00:03:49.930
That's not what I mean.

00:03:49.930 --> 00:03:50.620
Huh?

00:03:50.810 --> 00:03:53.580
It's that line, "Why do you 
always bring out dirty

00:03:53.580 --> 00:03:55.750
clothes after I start the laundry?"

00:03:56.250 --> 00:03:59.630
Every mom in every household says that.

00:03:59.920 --> 00:04:02.070
Is... that so?

00:04:02.070 --> 00:04:03.820
It's strange.

00:04:03.820 --> 00:04:06.110
Where would she learn that?

00:04:06.490 --> 00:04:08.260
Listen!

00:04:08.260 --> 00:04:09.960
I wonder if I'll become

00:04:09.960 --> 00:04:13.340
such a dignified mother one day?

00:04:13.340 --> 00:04:16.150
Maria-san is only 17.

00:04:16.150 --> 00:04:17.450
Good grief!

00:04:17.450 --> 00:04:19.760
I wanna be the one 
giving orders sometimes.

00:04:20.320 --> 00:04:21.280
What kind?

00:04:23.490 --> 00:04:25.410
Take your bath!

00:04:25.960 --> 00:04:27.830
Stop buying snacks!

00:04:28.280 --> 00:04:29.280
And such.

00:04:29.670 --> 00:04:32.410
I don't think Maria-san would ever 
need to be told those things.

00:04:32.410 --> 00:04:36.540
I just wanna tell 
Maria not to do something!

00:04:37.720 --> 00:04:39.490
So, Hayate.

00:04:39.490 --> 00:04:42.920
Discover what sort of
 bad things Maria is doing.

00:04:43.970 --> 00:04:46.030
<i>What?</i>

00:04:49.580 --> 00:04:52.620
<b> Candy Land</b>

00:04:53.210 --> 00:04:54.330
Um...

00:04:54.330 --> 00:04:55.640
Thanks, as always.

00:04:55.920 --> 00:04:58.320
<i>She's so beautiful.</i>

00:04:59.360 --> 00:05:03.260
<i>And here I am, lurking in the shadows.</i>

00:05:04.570 --> 00:05:06.590
<i>I've become a stalker.</i>

00:05:09.930 --> 00:05:12.200
<i>Hm... That's odd.</i>

00:05:12.470 --> 00:05:15.620
<b> Free Milkshake</b>

00:05:13.440 --> 00:05:15.620
I'll take a strawberry shake.

00:05:15.900 --> 00:05:18.990
Right away. Anything else?

00:05:18.990 --> 00:05:20.090
No.

00:05:20.090 --> 00:05:22.670
Would you like a burger with that?

00:05:22.670 --> 00:05:23.760
No thanks.

00:05:27.850 --> 00:05:29.840
<i>There's nothing wrong with her...</i>

00:05:30.740 --> 00:05:32.450
<i>...I think.</i>

00:05:40.670 --> 00:05:43.230
<i>Watching her like this,</i>

00:05:43.230 --> 00:05:45.810
<i>I realize there's a lot 
about her I don't know.</i>

00:05:50.350 --> 00:05:51.710
<i>She's so pretty.</i>

00:06:01.560 --> 00:06:04.670
<i>I never knew Maria-san 
bought so many snacks.</i>

00:06:08.850 --> 00:06:09.680
Hello?

00:06:10.500 --> 00:06:15.600
Hayate? Did you find something 
I can tell Maria not to do?

00:06:15.600 --> 00:06:16.930
I'll take this.

00:06:16.460 --> 00:06:19.100
<i>Well...</i>

00:06:16.930 --> 00:06:19.100
Thank you. You must be a fine wife.

00:06:19.100 --> 00:06:20.870
Oh, no, I'm single.

00:06:19.750 --> 00:06:22.110
<i>Unlike you, she doesn't do anything wrong.</i>

00:06:22.110 --> 00:06:24.610
<i>What?</i>

00:06:25.830 --> 00:06:26.990
I'm home...

00:06:27.590 --> 00:06:30.230
Welcome back. How was school?

00:06:30.230 --> 00:06:31.950
You haven't gone in a while.

00:06:33.220 --> 00:06:36.640
Oh my. You're still upset?

00:06:38.840 --> 00:06:40.420
That's all right.

00:06:41.920 --> 00:06:43.450
By the way,

00:06:44.300 --> 00:06:46.050
want some ice cream, since it's hot out?

00:06:49.240 --> 00:06:50.260
Yes!

00:06:53.740 --> 00:06:56.140
Yes, you're just like a mother.

00:06:56.710 --> 00:07:01.520
I'm not old enough to 
have a child her age.

00:07:01.520 --> 00:07:04.230
Uh... That's not what I meant.

00:07:04.230 --> 00:07:05.900
I'm gonna play a video game!

00:07:08.800 --> 00:07:14.010
In some aspects, you're like 
a mother to Miss Nagi.

00:07:17.380 --> 00:07:20.060
<i>I never met my dad,</i>

00:07:20.060 --> 00:07:22.470
<i>and I don't have any photos...</i>

00:07:22.470 --> 00:07:24.560
<i>And my mom died...</i>

00:07:34.900 --> 00:07:36.140
What is it?

00:07:36.440 --> 00:07:40.520
I'd like to ask you 
something, grandfather.

00:07:42.380 --> 00:07:45.240
It's about Nagi's father.

00:07:46.140 --> 00:07:48.130
Something has been nagging at me,

00:07:48.130 --> 00:07:50.260
so I've been doing some research...

00:07:50.260 --> 00:07:52.520
But I can't even find one picture.

00:07:53.340 --> 00:07:57.120
I destroyed all his photos. 
All records of him, too.

00:07:57.710 --> 00:07:59.540
Of course you can't find anything.

00:07:59.770 --> 00:08:01.210
You did, grandfather?

00:08:01.760 --> 00:08:05.130
But who exactly is Nagi's father?

00:08:05.130 --> 00:08:06.910
<i>Humph. Who cares!</i>

00:08:07.790 --> 00:08:10.870
I don't want to remember
 the thief who died

00:08:10.870 --> 00:08:12.420
in that car crash in America!

00:08:14.870 --> 00:08:17.430
He was an embarrassment 
to the Sanzenin house.

00:08:17.430 --> 00:08:19.930
No more than a disgrace!

00:08:19.930 --> 00:08:24.060
Don't ask me about him anymore!

00:08:25.050 --> 00:08:26.580
I see...

00:08:28.080 --> 00:08:31.210
But... Putting that aside...

00:08:31.210 --> 00:08:34.070
Could you just give me 
the essentials in brief?

00:08:34.570 --> 00:08:38.580
I'm in the middle of preparing 
dinner, so make it quick.

00:08:35.830 --> 00:08:38.580
<i>Um... Uh... Well...</i>

00:08:41.360 --> 00:08:44.160
His name was Shin Hayek and

00:08:44.160 --> 00:08:46.330
he was Yukariko's former butler.

00:08:46.330 --> 00:08:49.990
In truth, he was a con man 
who got close to us

00:08:49.990 --> 00:08:52.280
in order to steal the Sanzenin treasure.

00:09:06.940 --> 00:09:09.020
People tend to believe their eyes,

00:09:10.140 --> 00:09:12.400
and ignore the invisible.

00:09:12.810 --> 00:09:14.350
That is the way humans are.

00:09:15.420 --> 00:09:20.910
Is what you see actually real, or...?

00:09:29.770 --> 00:09:33.550
That's funny. Was I scammed?

00:09:34.090 --> 00:09:34.990
<b>Care for a glass?</b>

00:09:35.780 --> 00:09:37.490
<b>Spirits</b>

00:09:36.380 --> 00:09:37.720
<i>To the next place!</i>

00:09:38.360 --> 00:09:42.290
<i>I wonder why money 
disappears when you spend it.</i>

00:09:43.620 --> 00:09:46.210
<b>Connecting</b>

00:09:44.250 --> 00:09:46.210
<b>Theater</b>

00:09:45.040 --> 00:09:46.210
<b>Part A</b>

00:09:46.250 --> 00:09:48.210
<b><i>Sanzenin Ramen</i></b>

00:09:48.440 --> 00:09:50.410
I made a discovery.

00:09:50.410 --> 00:09:51.260
What?

00:09:51.260 --> 00:09:52.310
Instead of letting ramen

00:09:52.310 --> 00:09:53.980
sit in hot water for three minutes...

00:09:53.980 --> 00:09:57.550
The noodles soak up more 
flavor and taste better if

00:09:57.550 --> 00:09:59.870
you let them sit for 10 minutes, right?

00:09:59.870 --> 00:10:01.220
Like I would know!

00:10:02.810 --> 00:10:05.660
<b>Connecting</b>

00:10:03.430 --> 00:10:05.660
<b>Theater</b>

00:10:04.220 --> 00:10:05.660
<b>Part B</b>

00:10:05.680 --> 00:10:07.160
<b><i> Sanzenin Ramen</i></b>

00:10:07.460 --> 00:10:10.320
The noodles are so overcooked, 
it's not ramen anymore.

00:10:10.320 --> 00:10:16.090
No! This super soft ramen is more
 like risotto, and it's delicious!

00:10:16.090 --> 00:10:19.090
Like I said, it's not ramen.

00:10:19.090 --> 00:10:21.720
So anyway, please lend me money!

00:10:23.040 --> 00:10:24.260
You idiot!

00:10:25.450 --> 00:10:27.520
You won't lend me anything today?

00:10:27.890 --> 00:10:29.020
No, I won't.

00:10:29.250 --> 00:10:32.190
But you did last time!

00:10:32.190 --> 00:10:33.650
Um, that was...

00:10:33.650 --> 00:10:36.170
You were so nice!

00:10:36.170 --> 00:10:38.530
Who were you then, Hina?

00:10:39.720 --> 00:10:40.860
That's because...

00:10:46.260 --> 00:10:48.100
Oh, whatever.

00:10:48.100 --> 00:10:51.060
Don't you think it's bad to 
borrow money from a sister

00:10:51.060 --> 00:10:52.540
who's 12 years younger?

00:10:52.890 --> 00:10:53.830
Nope.

00:10:53.830 --> 00:10:55.050
You should!

00:10:55.270 --> 00:10:58.280
Okay. I didn't word that right.

00:10:58.660 --> 00:11:00.290
Your big sister will rephrase.

00:11:01.360 --> 00:11:02.300
Give me money!

00:11:02.300 --> 00:11:04.260
That's worse!

00:11:05.850 --> 00:11:07.470
Oh well.

00:11:07.470 --> 00:11:10.850
I guess I'll have to go to some lender now.

00:11:10.850 --> 00:11:13.600
Do you remember why our real

00:11:13.600 --> 00:11:17.190
parents ran away and left us behind?

00:11:17.420 --> 00:11:21.910
Um... I think it was because they

00:11:21.910 --> 00:11:26.790
carelessly borrowed 80 million yen 
from lenders and loan sharks?

00:11:27.020 --> 00:11:28.470
That's right.

00:11:28.470 --> 00:11:31.460
So if you borrow money 
from loan sharks...

00:11:32.550 --> 00:11:34.910
I will never forgive you!

00:11:34.910 --> 00:11:38.420
Sorry! I'm really sorry!

00:11:41.930 --> 00:11:43.810
I'm very hungry,

00:11:44.680 --> 00:11:48.010
but I can't get anything 
to eat with 12 yen.

00:11:51.940 --> 00:11:53.440
<i>Found a sucker.</i>

00:11:55.050 --> 00:11:56.860
Man, you eat a lot.

00:11:57.580 --> 00:11:59.860
Ha, ha. I'm just starving.

00:12:00.360 --> 00:12:03.780
And please, don't ask me 
if there's a better job

00:12:03.780 --> 00:12:05.730
than teaching at Hakuo.

00:12:06.150 --> 00:12:09.120
You have to stay grounded and work hard.

00:12:09.120 --> 00:12:09.600
I'll see you.

00:12:09.600 --> 00:12:11.000
You forgot the check!

00:12:11.210 --> 00:12:12.000
Huh?

00:12:12.360 --> 00:12:14.670
I only have 12 yen.

00:12:17.860 --> 00:12:21.340
Hey! I don't have much money, either.

00:12:21.340 --> 00:12:23.720
Even though you look like a host?

00:12:23.720 --> 00:12:26.160
Butlers have money, don't they?

00:12:26.160 --> 00:12:28.350
What are you talking about?

00:12:28.350 --> 00:12:30.390
Can't you even buy me some curry?

00:12:30.390 --> 00:12:33.390
You ate way more than just curry!

00:12:33.900 --> 00:12:35.540
Excuse me.

00:12:35.540 --> 00:12:38.640
You're disturbing the other customers.

00:12:38.640 --> 00:12:40.190
Oh, we're so sorry.

00:12:40.190 --> 00:12:42.280
Can I add a jumbo beef 
curry to our order?

00:12:42.280 --> 00:12:44.780
Why are you ordering?

00:12:44.780 --> 00:12:46.810
Oh well. Guess we have no choice

00:12:46.810 --> 00:12:49.120
but to call Nagi-chan and 
have her bail us out.

00:12:49.120 --> 00:12:51.720
"No choice"? That's not 
how you use that phrase.

00:12:52.240 --> 00:12:53.290
Absolutely not!

00:12:53.290 --> 00:12:56.210
Then how will we 
get out of this situation?

00:12:57.320 --> 00:12:59.500
First, relinquish the curry.

00:13:01.540 --> 00:13:05.860
I guess we can call someone with money.

00:13:05.860 --> 00:13:07.870
Okay, then call someone.

00:13:07.870 --> 00:13:10.050
You call, Teacher.

00:13:10.050 --> 00:13:11.770
How about Hinagiku-san?

00:13:12.820 --> 00:13:14.610
Call her and she'll kill us.

00:13:15.930 --> 00:13:19.190
I'm going to the bathroom.

00:13:19.550 --> 00:13:21.750
You don't need the toilet.
You were just gonna run.

00:13:21.920 --> 00:13:25.780
Wh-What? I wouldn't do that!

00:13:25.780 --> 00:13:27.920
My parents used to do the same thing.

00:13:27.920 --> 00:13:30.290
I know all the tricks.

00:13:30.290 --> 00:13:33.290
So cruel! I can't believe you'd 
accuse a teacher of such things!

00:13:33.290 --> 00:13:35.760
<i>I can't afford to give her any openings.</i>

00:13:35.760 --> 00:13:40.170
<i>But at this rate, I'll end up 
having to pay. What can I do...?</i>

00:13:40.170 --> 00:13:42.830
<i>Not bad, seeing through 
my act so quickly.</i>

00:13:42.830 --> 00:13:44.920
<i>Trust a guy with so much 
experience being in debt.</i>

00:13:44.920 --> 00:13:46.550
Kill or be killed...

00:13:47.100 --> 00:13:48.230
It's a close fight.

00:13:48.230 --> 00:13:50.050
This curry is so good!

00:13:50.320 --> 00:13:52.340
Whoa! Sister! Tsugumi-san!

00:13:52.340 --> 00:13:53.830
When did you get here?

00:13:53.830 --> 00:13:55.560
What are you doing?

00:13:55.560 --> 00:13:57.380
We're gonna dine and dash, of course!

00:13:57.380 --> 00:13:59.750
What do you mean, "of course"?

00:13:59.750 --> 00:14:00.690
That's right.

00:14:00.690 --> 00:14:02.320
And who are you?

00:14:02.320 --> 00:14:05.970
I'm the nun this young man
 is treating to a meal.

00:14:05.970 --> 00:14:07.450
I'm not treating you!

00:14:08.350 --> 00:14:09.820
You'd treat me, right?

00:14:10.490 --> 00:14:12.830
No! Where's your money?

00:14:12.830 --> 00:14:15.660
You think I have any money left after Akiba?

00:14:15.660 --> 00:14:17.940
Don't say that so proudly!

00:14:16.970 --> 00:14:20.740
<i>Excuse me. I'd like the steak set with extra rice.</i>

00:14:20.740 --> 00:14:22.920
Don't just place an order like normal!

00:14:22.920 --> 00:14:24.650
You're so cheap, Ayasaki-kun!

00:14:24.650 --> 00:14:26.880
And after we've finally met again...

00:14:26.880 --> 00:14:28.910
Since you're all having fun,

00:14:28.910 --> 00:14:30.510
I think it's time for me to leave.

00:14:31.060 --> 00:14:33.390
If you're leaving, then pay up.

00:14:33.920 --> 00:14:35.520
You guys, too.

00:14:35.520 --> 00:14:37.910
<i>Man, he doesn't leave any openings.</i>

00:14:37.910 --> 00:14:39.750
<i>You're going to try to run no matter what.</i>

00:14:39.750 --> 00:14:42.650
<i>I'll just have to eat more than anyone...</i>

00:14:42.650 --> 00:14:44.780
<i>And get out of here faster than anyone.</i>

00:14:45.940 --> 00:14:49.150
<i>And the last one left here 
has to pay the whole bill.</i>

00:14:52.380 --> 00:14:54.740
I wonder if I was too harsh.

00:14:54.740 --> 00:14:56.070
<i>We have breaking news.</i>

00:14:56.070 --> 00:14:59.000
<i>A thief armed with a gun is still at large.</i>

00:14:57.560 --> 00:15:00.540
<i>Breaking News</i>

00:14:57.560 --> 00:15:00.540
Armed Thief Still At Large

00:14:59.000 --> 00:15:02.540
<i>Local police are asking all 
citizens to be careful.</i>

00:15:02.540 --> 00:15:05.190
<i>How can they eat without 
the slightest hesitation</i>

00:15:05.190 --> 00:15:07.550
<i>when they know they 
can't pay the bill?</i>

00:15:08.690 --> 00:15:10.310
<i>What will I do?</i>

00:15:13.050 --> 00:15:14.010
<i>Right!</i>

00:15:14.010 --> 00:15:17.560
<i>It's perfectly normal to 
get up to answer the phone!</i>

00:15:19.020 --> 00:15:20.520
<i>I'll switch from "vibrate" to "ring,"</i>

00:15:20.520 --> 00:15:22.340
<i>and turn the volume up loud...</i>

00:15:23.020 --> 00:15:24.960
<i>Someone I can rely on to</i>

00:15:24.960 --> 00:15:27.780
<i>call me back if I hang up 
after one ring would be...</i>

00:15:28.980 --> 00:15:29.740
Huh?

00:15:31.280 --> 00:15:34.280
<b>1 Missed Call
Hayate Ayasaki</b>

00:15:31.510 --> 00:15:34.280
<i>Hayate-kun? I wonder what he wants...</i>

00:15:34.570 --> 00:15:37.300
<i>I should call him back...</i>

00:15:37.300 --> 00:15:40.290
<i>But should I make him wait a bit first?</i>

00:15:40.500 --> 00:15:42.710
<i>Um... Uh...</i>

00:15:43.940 --> 00:15:45.130
<i>No call yet?</i>

00:15:46.050 --> 00:15:48.340
<i>No call yet, Hinagiku-san?!</i>

00:15:49.670 --> 00:15:51.150
<i>I guess my plan isn't...</i>

00:15:51.150 --> 00:15:52.300
<b>Hinagiku Katsura</b>

00:15:52.560 --> 00:15:56.600
Oh, excuse me while I 
take this call... outside.

00:15:56.600 --> 00:15:57.350
What?

00:15:57.350 --> 00:15:58.140
Shoot!

00:15:58.140 --> 00:15:59.000
He got us!

00:15:59.000 --> 00:16:00.310
I never thought he'd pull that one!

00:16:01.290 --> 00:16:02.820
<i>Goodbye, everyone.</i>

00:16:01.670 --> 00:16:04.080
No, don't go!

00:16:02.820 --> 00:16:05.270
<i>The upper hand was mine this time.</i>

00:16:05.670 --> 00:16:07.530
Hello? Hi, Hinagiku-san.

00:16:08.140 --> 00:16:10.990
I'm at the Deathny's in Nogata.

00:16:11.610 --> 00:16:12.850
Excuse m—

00:16:13.610 --> 00:16:14.550
Hayate-kun?

00:16:16.930 --> 00:16:18.560
My smart phone!

00:16:18.560 --> 00:16:21.420
I'm taking over this restaurant!

00:16:21.990 --> 00:16:24.030
Nice! Nice assist!

00:16:24.030 --> 00:16:25.830
What's so nice about it?

00:16:27.460 --> 00:16:30.840
Chief, I managed to get footage 
from inside the restaurant.

00:16:31.200 --> 00:16:33.510
What's going on in there?

00:16:33.800 --> 00:16:35.680
There are four hostages.

00:16:35.680 --> 00:16:38.750
The thief is working alone, but he's 
armed and extremely dangerous.

00:16:38.750 --> 00:16:40.080
I see.

00:16:40.080 --> 00:16:42.390
But I wonder which of them is the thief?

00:16:42.390 --> 00:16:44.490
You're such a rookie.

00:16:44.490 --> 00:16:47.650
Can't you tell just by his aura?

00:16:47.650 --> 00:16:51.240
You guys better behave or else I'll...

00:16:54.950 --> 00:16:58.280
Good timing. What do you want to order?

00:16:58.280 --> 00:17:00.120
Huh? What are you talking about?

00:17:00.120 --> 00:17:02.410
I'm... Huh? What?

00:17:02.710 --> 00:17:04.980
Oh, whatever. Hurry up and order.

00:17:04.980 --> 00:17:06.040
Please...

00:17:06.500 --> 00:17:08.990
<i>Who are you guys?</i>

00:17:08.990 --> 00:17:11.310
Which one is our guy?

00:17:11.310 --> 00:17:13.050
Look at his aura.

00:17:13.050 --> 00:17:15.870
I'm glad there are more of us.

00:17:15.870 --> 00:17:18.300
More of us? I'm a thief.

00:17:18.640 --> 00:17:22.680
You're not really relying on the 
money he stole to pay, are you?

00:17:22.680 --> 00:17:23.730
Oh, come on.

00:17:23.730 --> 00:17:26.010
It doesn't matter who 
pays. Money is money.

00:17:26.010 --> 00:17:32.010
So, one of the five of us will 
pay the 40,000 yen bill, right?

00:17:32.010 --> 00:17:33.900
But I didn't order anything!

00:17:33.900 --> 00:17:37.650
Didn't you know? You get charged

00:17:37.650 --> 00:17:40.090
just to sit at many pubs.

00:17:40.090 --> 00:17:42.160
Here that charge is 50,000.

00:17:42.160 --> 00:17:44.160
Whoa! That's a huge charge!

00:17:44.430 --> 00:17:47.190
But I'm a thief! You should be scared of...

00:17:47.190 --> 00:17:49.670
I'll get us something 
from the drink station.

00:17:49.670 --> 00:17:51.150
What do you want?

00:17:52.620 --> 00:17:54.460
Um... I'll take a Coke.

00:17:54.460 --> 00:17:55.440
Juice!

00:17:55.440 --> 00:17:56.380
Coffee.

00:17:56.380 --> 00:17:57.150
Tea.

00:17:57.150 --> 00:18:00.160
Okay, I'll get everyone their drinks.

00:18:00.160 --> 00:18:00.880
Thanks.

00:18:00.880 --> 00:18:01.930
Thank you!

00:18:01.930 --> 00:18:02.970
No problem.

00:18:02.970 --> 00:18:04.800
Where's my juice?

00:18:04.800 --> 00:18:06.440
She just left.

00:18:08.140 --> 00:18:11.650
Um... Something's really bothering me.

00:18:11.650 --> 00:18:12.440
What?

00:18:12.440 --> 00:18:15.440
Did this restaurant 
have a drink station?

00:18:17.880 --> 00:18:19.780
Sister!

00:18:19.780 --> 00:18:20.490
She got us!

00:18:20.490 --> 00:18:21.910
She dined and dashed!

00:18:21.910 --> 00:18:24.830
Whoops! I slipped!

00:18:25.760 --> 00:18:27.050
She kicked her way out!

00:18:27.050 --> 00:18:29.330
We have to pay for the window, too?

00:18:29.550 --> 00:18:33.020
You or you are going to 
pay for all of this!

00:18:33.020 --> 00:18:36.350
Don't downplay your part in this!

00:18:36.350 --> 00:18:37.400
That's right!

00:18:37.400 --> 00:18:41.350
Besides, I stole all this money 
to help my sick sister.

00:18:41.580 --> 00:18:42.650
Your sick...

00:18:42.650 --> 00:18:43.850
Sister?

00:18:43.850 --> 00:18:45.150
Excuse me...

00:18:45.150 --> 00:18:46.550
Please keep out!

00:18:48.550 --> 00:18:50.560
Hayate-kun is here?

00:18:51.090 --> 00:18:53.970
My sister is really sick and

00:18:53.970 --> 00:18:56.420
it'll cost us a fortune to treat her.

00:18:56.420 --> 00:18:59.450
We're too poor to pay 
for her medical bills.

00:18:59.450 --> 00:19:01.570
But I want to help her...

00:19:01.570 --> 00:19:03.780
So that's why I stole the money...

00:19:03.780 --> 00:19:05.290
You idiot!

00:19:06.280 --> 00:19:07.540
Why did you do that?

00:19:07.540 --> 00:19:11.000
You're a fool to steal

00:19:11.000 --> 00:19:14.000
money to help your sick sister!

00:19:14.000 --> 00:19:15.380
Teacher...

00:19:15.380 --> 00:19:20.130
You're not thinking 
about your sister at all.

00:19:21.600 --> 00:19:25.490
With this money you 
used a gun to steal?!

00:19:27.470 --> 00:19:29.730
Do you think your little sister would be

00:19:29.730 --> 00:19:33.020
happy to be cured by stolen money?

00:19:35.720 --> 00:19:37.530
Don't point the gun at us!

00:19:37.530 --> 00:19:39.970
<i>Can't you see she'll just be sad?</i>

00:19:39.970 --> 00:19:42.530
<i>Lower the gun, Teacher!</i>

00:19:43.260 --> 00:19:44.800
Um, excuse me.

00:19:44.800 --> 00:19:47.040
Hm? Who are you?

00:19:47.040 --> 00:19:52.040
I got a call from a friend 
who I think is in there.

00:19:52.370 --> 00:19:56.050
Oh... Well, an armed thief 
is holed up in there.

00:19:56.050 --> 00:19:58.410
An armed thief?

00:20:01.770 --> 00:20:02.630
<i>Sister?</i>

00:20:03.780 --> 00:20:05.640
<i>My older sister stole money?</i>

00:20:06.490 --> 00:20:08.640
Anyway, I understand.

00:20:08.640 --> 00:20:11.140
What am I going to do?

00:20:11.140 --> 00:20:12.410
It's easy.

00:20:12.410 --> 00:20:15.020
Hand the dirty money
 over to me and...

00:20:15.020 --> 00:20:18.250
The only dirty thing is your mind!

00:20:21.340 --> 00:20:22.900
Huh? Oh, Hina?

00:20:22.900 --> 00:20:24.850
I've lost all faith in you, big sister!

00:20:24.850 --> 00:20:25.410
Huh?

00:20:26.010 --> 00:20:27.610
I looked up to you!

00:20:27.610 --> 00:20:29.450
I can't believe you'd 
 do this just because

00:20:29.450 --> 00:20:30.920
you don't have money!

00:20:33.820 --> 00:20:35.670
Wasn't it you who taught me that

00:20:35.670 --> 00:20:38.460
some things are worth more than money?

00:20:41.270 --> 00:20:42.710
Whatever the reason,

00:20:42.710 --> 00:20:46.000
didn't you realize your little sister 
would be sad if you stole money?

00:20:46.930 --> 00:20:51.620
Stop hiding in here and turn yourself in!

00:20:51.620 --> 00:20:54.280
Yes. I'll turn myself in.

00:20:57.160 --> 00:20:58.270
Who's this?

00:20:58.270 --> 00:20:59.570
The thief.

00:20:59.910 --> 00:21:01.310
What?

00:21:02.570 --> 00:21:04.150
I'm sorry I caused so much trouble.

00:21:04.150 --> 00:21:06.690
I'll take care of your little sister.

00:21:06.690 --> 00:21:09.080
Thank you so much!

00:21:12.310 --> 00:21:16.920
Idiot! Idiot! You're 
such an idiot, big sister!

00:21:16.920 --> 00:21:19.060
Okay, okay! I hear you.

00:21:19.060 --> 00:21:21.550
Now, lend me some money.

00:21:22.740 --> 00:21:24.970
I will not lend you money, you idiot!

00:21:24.970 --> 00:21:29.100
Um, Maria-san. I need to talk to you.

00:21:29.540 --> 00:21:31.850
Okay, as long as it's not about money.

00:21:31.850 --> 00:21:33.050
Shoot.

00:23:12.060 --> 00:23:13.820
So...

00:23:13.820 --> 00:23:15.870
I don't have anything.

00:23:15.870 --> 00:23:17.370
But I came to see you!

00:23:17.370 --> 00:23:19.340
Don't you have anything for me?

00:23:19.340 --> 00:23:21.230
Oh, all right.

00:23:21.230 --> 00:23:22.570
Come on, come on.

00:23:22.570 --> 00:23:24.170
You can have this.

00:23:24.170 --> 00:23:25.140
What's this?

00:23:25.140 --> 00:23:27.000
The bill.

00:23:27.000 --> 00:23:30.020
For the ramen, steak set, 
and all the other food.

00:23:30.790 --> 00:23:32.040
Hey! You can't escape!

00:23:32.040 --> 00:23:35.010
Pay for what you ate! Sister!

00:23:35.010 --> 00:23:38.690
Pay! You have to pay up, Sister!
